<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="tool-intro"><view class="tool-intro-kicker">防健忘 · 临期排序</view><view class="tool-intro-title">先处理日期更近的食物</view><view class="tool-intro-desc">登记包装日期或你计划吃完的日期，列表自动把更紧急的食物排在前面。</view></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="section-title-row"><view class="section-title">加入一份食物</view><button class="example-chip" bindtap="fillExample" hover-class="example-chip--pressed">试试示例</button></view><view class="surface form-card"><view class="field"><view class="field-label">食物名称</view><input class="field-input" value="{{name}}" maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：开封牛奶" placeholder-class="field-placeholder" bindinput="onNameInput" /></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">包装日期或计划处理日</view><picker mode="date" value="{{expiryDate}}" bindchange="onDateChange"><view class="field-picker">{{expiryDate}}</view></picker></view><button class="primary-button form-submit" bindtap="addRecord">加入先吃列表</button></view></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="section-title">从上往下优先处理</view><view wx:if="{{sorted.length}}"><view class="surface record-card" wx:for="{{sorted}}" wx:key="id"><view class="record-head"><view class="record-main"><view class="record-title">{{item.name}}<text class="record-tag {{item.tone == 'danger' ? 'record-tag--danger' : item.tone == 'warning' ? 'record-tag--warning' : ''}}">{{item.text}}</text></view><view class="record-meta">填写日期：{{item.expiryDate}}</view></view><button class="text-action" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="removeRecord">吃完了</button></view></view></view><view class="surface empty-state" wx:else><view class="empty-mark">鲜</view><text>冰箱列表还是空的</text></view></view>
  <view class="notice">本工具只按你填写的日期排序，不判断食物是否安全、可食用或实际变质；请结合包装说明和食物状态自行判断。</view>
</view>
